      {
        "n": "ARCHIVED W/ ROTATIONAL - STREET KUDURO 2 (R)",
        "s": "2026-09-11T03:00:00+01:00",
        "e": "2026-09-11T04:00:00+01:00",
        "d": "Monthly reports from Rotational, the archivist & DJ focussing on electronic dance music from Africa and South-America. Dance to the sound of digitized kuduro CDs, baile funk found on a USB-stick from Rio, or Moroccan techno from dusty cassette tapes. Besides DJing, Rotational also runs a YouTube channel filled with musical finds from all around the world.\nFrom the host: \"A while back I ran a street kuduro special. Heavy, aggressive beats, hypnotic synth loops. Some faces from the last episode, some brand new.\"",
